      "id": "IZS-01",
      "title": "Row and corner classes in an inert Iwasawa cell",
      "statement": "For n=m+2 over an unramified quadratic local extension with its conjugation, fix the signed outer valuation a and a rank-m integral-stabilizer coset with length h. Radical cosets have length at least H=|a|+h, and the count through H+j equals q^{2h+(2m+2)max(a,0)} q^{2m floor(j/2)+j}.",
